<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Security Awareness Training - Simulated Test</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-dark: #0b1329;
            --card-bg: #131b35;
            --accent-teal: #00e5ff;
            --accent-glow: rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.15);
            --text-main: #f8fafc;
            --text-muted: #94a3b8;
            --border-color: #1e293b;
        }
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-dark);
            color: var(--text-main);
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        .container {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 580px;
            border-top: 6px solid var(--accent-teal);
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        .badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            background-color: var(--accent-glow);
            color: var(--accent-teal);
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 12px;
            padding: 6px 14px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 24px;
            margin-top: 0;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            color: var(--text-main);
        }
        p.subtitle {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.5;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }
        .indicators-box, .tips-box {
            background-color: #0b1329;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .indicators-box h3, .tips-box h3 {
            font-size: 15px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            margin-top: 0;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            color: var(--accent-teal);
        }
        .indicator-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        .indicator-item:last-child {
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }
        .icon-wrapper {
            background-color: var(--accent-glow);
            color: var(--accent-teal);
            padding: 8px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .icon-wrapper svg {
            width: 20px;
            height: 20px;
            fill: currentColor;
        }
        .indicator-text {
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.4;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }
        .indicator-text strong {
            color: var(--text-main);
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 2px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="badge">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" height="14" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm1 15h-2v-2h2v2zm0-4h-2V7h2v6z"/></svg>
            Security Awareness Notice
        </div>
        <h1>This Was a Simulated Phishing Test</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">
            You just scanned a QR code from a controlled simulation test. No data was compromised, but this serves as a secure, just-in-time reminder of how attackers bypass traditional security filters using mobile devices.
        </p>

        <!-- Warning Signs Section -->
        <div class="indicators-box">
            <h3>Warning Signs You Should Have Noticed</h3>
            
            <div class="indicator-item">
                <div class="icon-wrapper">
                    <!-- Clock/Urgency Icon -->
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M11.99 2C6.47 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.47 10 9.99 10C17.52 22 22 17.58 22 12s-4.48-10-10.01-10zM12 20c-4.42 0-8-3.58-8-8s3.58-8 8-8 8 3.58 8 8-3.58 8-8 8zm.5-13H11v6l5.25 3.15.75-1.23-4.5-2.67z"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div class="indicator-text">
                    <strong>Urgent Request</strong>
                    The message pressured you to take immediate action without giving time to evaluate the context.
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="indicator-item">
                <div class="icon-wrapper">
                    <!-- Document Icon -->
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14 2H6c-1.1 0-1.99.9-1.99 2L4 20c0 1.1.89 2 1.99 2H18c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V8l-6-6zm2 16H8v-2h8v2zm0-4H8v-2h8v2zm-3-5V3.5L18.5 9H13z"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div class="indicator-text">
                    <strong>Unexpected PDF Attachment</strong>
                    The document content or context was completely out of the ordinary or unsolicited.
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="indicator-item">
                <div class="icon-wrapper">
                    <!-- QR Code Icon -->
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 3h8v8H3V3zm2 2v4h4V5H5zm8-2h8v8h-8V3zm2 2v4h4V5h-4zM3 13h8v8H3v-8zm2 2v4h4v-4H5zm13-2h3v2h-3v-2zM13 19h2v2h-2v-2zm2-4h2v2h-2v-2zm4 0h2v2h-2v-2zm-2 4h2v2h-2v-2zm2 2h3v2h-3v-2z"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div class="indicator-text">
                    <strong>QR Code (Quishing)</strong>
                    Using a QR code forces you onto your mobile device where security banners and URL inspection tools are hidden.
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="indicator-item">
                <div class="icon-wrapper">
                    <!-- Shield/Verification Icon -->
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 1L3 5v6c0 5.55 3.84 10.74 9 12 5.16-1.26 9-6.45 9-12V5l-9-4zm0 10.99h7c-.53 4.12-3.28 7.79-7 8.94V12H5V6.3l7-3.11v8.8z"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div class="indicator-text">
                    <strong>Lack of Verification</strong>
                    Unusual requests concerning HR or credentials should always be cross-checked through an established, trusted internal channel.
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- What to Do in the Future Section -->
        <div class="tips-box">
            <h3>What to Do in the Future</h3>
            
            <div class="indicator-item">
                <div class="icon-wrapper">
                    <!-- Pause/Stop Icon -->
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 19h4V5H6v14zm8-14v14h4V5h-4z"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div class="indicator-text">
                    <strong>Pause and Evaluate</strong>
                    If the urgency disappears when you step back, it was a scam. Stop and think before acting.
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="indicator-item">
                <div class="icon-wrapper">
                    <!-- Link/URL Check Icon -->
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3.9 12c0-1.71 1.39-3.1 3.1-3.1h4V7H7c-2.76 0-5 2.24-5 5s2.24 5 5 5h4v-1.9H7c-1.71 0-3.1-1.39-3.1-3.1zM8 13h8v-2H8v2zm9-6h-4v1.9h4c1.71 0 3.1 1.39 3.1 3.1s-1.39 3.1-3.1 3.1h-4V17h4c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5s-2.24-5-5-5z"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div class="indicator-text">
                    <strong>Verify via Trusted Channels</strong>
                    Verify unexpected login or payment requests through a trusted, typed-in URL—never via a link from an unsolicited message.
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="indicator-item">
                <div class="icon-wrapper">
                    <!-- Lock/Credential Icon -->
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M18 8h-1V6c0-2.76-2.24-5-5-5S7 3.24 7 6v2H6c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v10c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h12c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V10c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2zm-6 9c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2s.9-2 2-2 2 .9 2 2-.9 2-2 2zm3.1-9H8.9V6c0-1.71 1.39-3.1 3.1-3.1 1.71 0 3.1 1.39 3.1 3.1v2z"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div class="indicator-text">
                    <strong>Protect Your Credentials</strong>
                    Never enter credentials after clicking a link from an unexpected email or message.
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
